Package: percona-mongodb-mongot
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, adduser
Description: MongoDB Search (mongot) for Percona Server for MongoDB.
 MongoDB Search (mongot) provides Full Text and Vector Search capabilities for
 MongoDB. It is intended to run alongside Percona Server for MongoDB to serve
 search queries and manage search indexes.
